  "changes": [
    "Existing event, asset, campaign, announcement and case conversation creation moved unchanged from ChatService to ResourceConversationService. Existing EventConversations and CaseConversations contracts and the POST /activities/chats/service route are retained.",
    "Case access predicates and per-session-mode WebSocket audience lookup are separate installed providers. Full MyScoutee retains the same participant checks, owner reads, exceptions and mode restoration; generic chat requires no community owner and does not filter stored channel types.",
    "Resource chat member pagination remains one owner page/count and one batched profile read. Personal chat uses its existing stored member-ID pagination.",
    "SupportWorkspaceDirectory reuses GroupDirectory.findById locally/remotely, with the same single lookup, base-ID and absent/present-null-name behavior.",
    "Existing system-message constants and activity-only context helpers are separated from generic message mapping. No persisted model, Mongo query, HTTP path or installed authorization rule changed."
  ],
